[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8642.55, "timestamp": "02:24:02", "text": "正在做的就是发布短视频。哦，是的。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8645.11, "timestamp": "02:24:05", "text": "我看到了。太好玩了。我目睹了死亡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8647.27, "timestamp": "02:24:07", "text": "匹配一。不，没那么好玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8649.99, "timestamp": "02:24:09", "text": "但是，呃，你去哪儿会让你感到害怕之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8652.79, "timestamp": "02:24:12", "text": "你用那个……呃，那个叫什么来着？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8655.349, "timestamp": "02:24:15", "text": "它？白羊座就像砰砰砰砰。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8659.11, "timestamp": "02:24:19", "text": "那个。是的，我很喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8662.63, "timestamp": "02:24:22", "text": "是的，我发了两条帖子，就像我拿到新手机一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8663.469, "timestamp": "02:24:23", "text": "过去的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8665.429, "timestamp": "02:24:25", "text": "上面有恐同症之类的东西。你应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8667.87, "timestamp": "02:24:27", "text": "看看。太搞笑了。我其实"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8670.07, "timestamp": "02:24:30", "text": "已编辑。对了，新年快乐。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8672.87, "timestamp": "02:24:32", "text": "新年快乐。谢谢。新年快乐"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8676.389, "timestamp": "02:24:36", "text": "也祝你新年快乐。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8678.71, "timestamp": "02:24:38", "text": "哦，新年快乐。我忘了说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8681.51, "timestamp": "02:24:41", "text": "又来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8683.03, "timestamp": "02:24:43", "text": "新年快乐。我觉得你不需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8684.87, "timestamp": "02:24:44", "text": "要知道这么说是因为我认为我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8687.27, "timestamp": "02:24:47", "text": "我们扯着嗓子尖叫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8689.75, "timestamp": "02:24:49", "text": "午夜。所以我觉得你不需要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8693.429, "timestamp": "02:24:53", "text": "我觉得你没必要读它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8695.59, "timestamp": "02:24:55", "text": "我们放声尖叫，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8697.349, "timestamp": "02:24:57", "text": "我们将在屋顶上大声呐喊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8699.99, "timestamp": "02:24:59", "text": "现在肺部。就这样吧。"}]